  "description": "IMEX.Core v2.0: Ultra-high-performance Hybrid Cache for .NET 8/9/10. Production-tested: 199ns L1 hit (5x faster than target), 40M ops/sec capacity, zero lock contention. Features: L1/L2 caching, MessagePack serialization, circuit breaker, fail-safe, background refresh, single-flight, Redis integration, comprehensive monitoring. Battle-tested with full production config.",
